            <h6 style="color: #ffffff !important; font-size: 0.85rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">1. Key Factors to Consider When Hiring an Interior Designer in Navi Mumbai</h6>
            <p class="mb-3" style="color: #a6a097 !important;">Unlike typical design consultants who only offer layouts on paper and leave you to coordinate with unverified local carpenters, we provide a single-source turnkey execution model. Managing a home interior design project involves coordinating multiple tasks, including structural modifications, electrical rewiring, tiling masonry, false ceiling Gyproc framing, custom plumbing, and modular furniture assembly. A turnkey contractor takes absolute responsibility for material dispatch, artisan supervision, building approvals, and execution timelines, protecting you from scheduling delays and rising material costs. Before finalizing your designer, ask for a detailed, itemized Bill of Quantities (BOQ). A transparent BOQ prevents hidden charges and specifies the exact brands of materials, hardware, and adhesives that will go into your site.</p>
            
